<title>CHINA: Thailand sees covered warrant trade this year.</title>
<headline>Thailand sees covered warrant trade this year.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand should introduce covered warrant trading by the middle of this year, the secretary general of Thailand's Securities Exchange Commission (SEC) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Pakorn Malakul na Ayudhya said the SEC would soon propose to the Thai Cabinet a draft of the Derivatives Market Act governing derivatives trading.</p>
<p>&quot;We should have covered warrants by the middle of this year,&quot; he told reporters at an international securities conference in Beijing.</p>
